<view class="page">
  <view class="banner">
    <view class="banner-kicker">初中 · 七至九年级</view>
    <view class="banner-title">各科学习</view>
    <view class="banner-desc">按教材模块整理知识点与考点，支持搜索、年级筛选和页内练习</view>
    <view class="banner-meta">
      <text>{{subjects.length}} 个学科</text>
      <text class="dot">·</text>
      <text>{{readyModules}} / {{totalModules}} 个模块已上线</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-label">选择学科</view>

  <view class="grid">
    <view
      wx:for="{{subjects}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="subject"
      bindtap="onOpen"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
    >
      <view class="subject-top">
        <view class="subject-icon" style="background: {{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</view>
        <view class="subject-name-wrap">
          <view class="subject-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="subject-score">{{item.score}} 分</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="subject-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      <view class="subject-foot">
        <text class="subject-count {{item.readyCount ? 'on' : ''}}">
          {{item.readyCount ? '已上线 ' + item.readyCount : '内容建设中'}} / {{item.moduleCount}}
        </text>
        <view class="progress">
          <view class="progress-in" style="width: {{item.percent}}%; background: {{item.color}}"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note-card">
    <view class="note-title">学习方式</view>
    <view class="note-row">进入学科后按模块学习；页面顶部可搜索标题、作者或标签，也可按年级筛选。</view>
    <view class="note-row">带“N 题”标记的知识点配有练习，选择题即时判分，简答题可查看参考答案与踩分点。</view>
    <view class="note-row">物理、化学的图解（光路、电路、装置图等）由程序绘制，随内容数据一起更新。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">内容依据教材与广州中考要求整理，仅供学习参考</view>
</view>
